","r":[0.1611,0.7615,0.0324,0.0259]},{"n":"Chevreuse","r":[0.2009,0.7615,0.0324,0.0259]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/yaemiko/261125-011421/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Kagura's Verity","text":"Yae's signature weapon, providing massive CRIT DMG and stacking Elemental Skill DMG bonuses that perfectly complement her Sesshou Sakura."},{"name":"Reliquary of Truth","text":"Provides substantial CRIT DMG, additional CRIT Rate, and Elemental Mastery, making it a powerful alternative across multiple builds."},{"name":"Skyward Atlas","text":"High Base ATK and ATK% with an Elemental DMG bonus; strong unconditional offensive stats."},{"name":"A Thousand Floating Dreams","text":"Large Elemental Mastery stat and modest party EM utility; strong for reaction-focused teams."},{"name":"The Widsith","text":"Offers valuable CRIT DMG and powerful random buffs, making it one of Yae's strongest 4-star damage options."},{"name":"Echoes of the Heart","text":"A strong craftable option providing ATK, Elemental Mastery, and Stellar-Conduct DMG bonuses. Particularly effective in teams with reliable reaction uptime."},{"name":"Flowing Purity","text":"Craftable ATK% catalyst that can grant Elemental DMG after using a Skill, provided its Bond of Life is cleared with healing."},{"name":"Oathsworn Eye","text":"Event catalyst with ATK% and extra Energy Recharge after using her Skill. Helpful for Burst uptime."}],"a":[{"names":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"text":"Best personal Stellar-Conduct set; boosts reaction damage and CRIT against affected enemies. Avoid Electro DMG Goblet.","stats":"CR / CD > ATK% > EM > ER"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Gives EM and ATK after reactions. Useful for Aggravate or reaction-focused setups.","stats":"ER > CR / CD > ATK% > EM"},{"names":["Golden Troupe"],"text":"Strong traditional off-field Skill set. Its DMG bonus does not improve Stellar-Conduct reaction damage.","stats":"CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG > EM > ATK% > ER (as needed)"}],"t":[{"name":"Three Geniuses & Qiqi","members":["Yae Miko","Sandrone","Nicole","qiqi"],"text":"Yae and Sandrone provide off-field Electro damage and coordinated attacks, while Nicole buffs the team and Qiqi keeps everyone alive. A flexible, sustained-damage team with plenty of off-field pressure.","roles":["Off-field DPS","On-field DPS","Shielder / Buffer","Healer"]},{"name":"Sparkle Prince","members":["Yae Miko","Mitya","qiqi","Odette"],"text":"Yae provides off-field Electro damage while Mitya and Odette drive the team’s Stellar reactions. Qiqi adds healing and sustain, keeping the team comfortable through extended fights.","roles":["Off-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Enabler","Healer","Cryo Enabler / Buffer"]},{"name":"I’m Aggravated","members":["Yae Miko","Alhaitham","Nahida","Baizhu"],"text":"Alhaitham drives on-field Dendro damage while Yae triggers Aggravate with consistent Electro application. Nahida boosts Dendro damage and EM, while Baizhu provides healing and additional reaction support.","roles":["Off-field DPS","On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Healer / Shielder"]},{"name":"Resting Ei Face","members":["Yae Miko","Raiden Shogun","Nicole","Chevreuse"],"text":"Raiden handles on-field damage while Yae adds off-field Electro. Nicole shields and buffs ATK, and Chevreuse strengthens Pyro and Electro damage through Overloaded.","roles":["Off-field DPS","On-field DPS","Shielder / Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Aggravate Turrets: Sustain turret damage and frequent Aggravates.\nStellar-Conduct: Use reaction-specific bonuses only where their conditions trigger.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Off-Field DPS"],"about":"Yae Miko delivers consistent off-field Electro damage with strong reaction synergy. Her versatility makes her a great fit for Stellar-Conduct and Aggravate teams.","pros":["Excellent off-field damage","Stellar-Conduct synergy","Flexible teams","Long-lasting turret uptime"],"cons":["Burst requires field time.","Energy-hungry outside Stellar-Conduct","Reaction-dependent damage ceiling"],"weapons":["Kagura's Verity","Reliquary of Truth","Skyward Atlas","A Thousand Floating Dreams","The Widsith","Echoes of the Heart","Flowing Purity","Oathsworn Eye"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Stellar Sub DPS"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Alt Stellar Sub DPS"},{"sets":["Golden Troupe"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Electro Sub DPS"}],"main":["ATK% / EM","ATK% / EM (Stellar); Electro DMG (Aggravate)","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["CR: Balance after set buffs","CD: Aim for a 1:2 CRIT ratio","EM: ~100–300 (Stellar)","ATK: After CRIT and EM","ER: Not a Stellar priority"],"vars":[{"title":"Aggravate Turrets","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Kagura's Verity","A Thousand Floating Dreams"],"arts":[{"sets":["Golden Troupe"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% or EM / Electro / CRIT.","teams":"Dendro partner to maintain Quicken.","when":"Sustain turret damage and frequent Aggravates.","cond":"","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Stellar-Conduct","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Kagura's Verity","Skyward Atlas"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% or EM Sands; ATK%/EM Goblet; CRIT Circlet. Target ~100–300 EM; Burst is optional.","teams":"A qualifying Stellar-Conduct reaction team.","when":"Use reaction-specific bonuses only where their conditions trigger.","cond":"Stellar-Conduct only; Electro DMG bonuses and Golden Troupe do not buff reaction damage.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vajrada Amethyst Sliver","Vajrada Amethyst Fragment","Vajrada Amethyst Chunk","Vajrada Amethyst Gemstone","Dragonheir's False Fin","Teachings of Light","Guide to Light","Philosophies of Light","Old Handguard","Kageuchi Handguard","Famed Handguard","Sea Ganoderma","The Meaning of Aeons","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Three Geniuses & Qiqi","members":["Yae Miko","Sandrone","Nicole","qiqi"]},{"name":"Sparkle Prince","members":["Yae Miko","Mitya","qiqi","Odette"]},{"name":"I’m Aggravated","members":["Yae Miko","Alhaitham","Nahida","Baizhu"]},{"name":"Resting Ei Face","members":["Yae Miko","Raiden Shogun","Nicole","Chevreuse"]}]}}],"title":"Yae Miko","el":"Electro"}